               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Simultaneously herewith, the Owner and the Buyer have entered i</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Simultaneously herewith, the Owner and the Buyer have entered into an escrow agreement regarding â‚¬11,500.00, dated June 4, 2025, which covers the purchase and delivery of the  Ducati 998S Final Edition (2004), and which is incorporated herein by this reference.  In accordance with its provisions, the parties agree as follows:</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>The Seller must make the vehicle available to the escrow servic</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>The Seller must make the vehicle available to the escrow service for inspection. The Escrow Agent shall verify that the Ownerâ€™s vehicle is in proper condition.  The Buyer hereby agrees to deposit with the Escrow Agent cash or cash equivalents in such form and in an amount sufficient to meet the current transaction requirements.   Upon verification of payment, the Owner is entitled to release the vehicle and provide the Buyer with tracking information.  The Buyer takes delivery of the vehicle. The Buyer has a fixed period of three (3) days to inspect the vehicle, with the option to accept or reject it. If it is not approved, the Buyer may raise a dispute and participate in the dispute resolution process. The refund will be issued after a period of seven (7) days.   The escrow service pays the Owner. If the vehicle is accepted by the Buyer, the escrow service releases funds from the escrow account to the Owner.  The Escrow Agent will be compensated for their services from the funds deposited with the Escrow Agent.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Daniel Voigt (the owner),</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Daniel Voigt (the owner),</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Iain Hamill (the buyer),</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Iain Hamill (the buyer),</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Aurel Balaiu (the escrow agent),</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Aurel Balaiu (the escrow agent),</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
